{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Untitled-1.png?t=1746077639\" />Smoke Break! is a 3D stealth puzzle game where you play as Applewood, a living puff of smoke, who's hungry for a sweet, charred treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this lighthearted adventure, mischief seekers will explore Applewood Factories \u2014 a whimsical pie-producing workshop. Cause hilarious hijinks as you delve deeper into this fantastical factory for a deliciously burnt pie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Untitled-2__1_.png?t=1746077639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COLLECT SMOKE TO GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedy navigation will burn away Applewood's size. Seek out smoke particles scattered around the factory and absorb them to stay puffed up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Collect_Smoke.gif?t=1746077639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAUSE MISCHIEF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip through vents, burrow into sacks of flour, and sabotage sweet machinery as you slink your way through pastry-packed corridors.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Cause_Mischief.gif?t=1746077639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware of the adorably aggressive bakers as they make every effort to keep you out. If that\u2019s not enough, Gumbo the Janitor\u2014a one-man cleanup crew with a turbo-charged vacuum\u2014has zero tolerance for your smoky shenanigans. Stay sneaky, or it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Don_t_Get_Caught.gif?t=1746077639\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564090?t=1746077639","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564090?t=1746077639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/630fe3cc4973e8ad0af29d37b94b870aa5d9abdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746077639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/630fe3cc4973e8ad0af29d37b94b870aa5d9abdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746077639","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Untitled-1.png?t=1746077639\" />Smoke Break! is a 3D stealth puzzle game where you play as Applewood, a living puff of smoke, who's hungry for a sweet, charred treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this lighthearted adventure, mischief seekers will explore Applewood Factories \u2014 a whimsical pie-producing workshop. Cause hilarious hijinks as you delve deeper into this fantastical factory for a deliciously burnt pie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Untitled-2__1_.png?t=1746077639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COLLECT SMOKE TO GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedy navigation will burn away Applewood's size. Seek out smoke particles scattered around the factory and absorb them to stay puffed up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Collect_Smoke.gif?t=1746077639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAUSE MISCHIEF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip through vents, burrow into sacks of flour, and sabotage sweet machinery as you slink your way through pastry-packed corridors.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Cause_Mischief.gif?t=1746077639\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware of the adorably aggressive bakers as they make every effort to keep you out. If that\u2019s not enough, Gumbo the Janitor\u2014a one-man cleanup crew with a turbo-charged vacuum\u2014has zero tolerance for your smoky shenanigans. Stay sneaky, or it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/Don_t_Get_Caught.gif?t=1746077639\" /></p>","developers":["Applewood Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/59a49be4613e1075338bf562c16e507744bf782f/header.jpg?t=1746077639","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Smoke Break!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 950 or RX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</s